# FigDown — figures as text. Spec: https://github.com/FigDown/figdown

figdown 0.1 table
table ta "Group Matrix — two-tier header with label column"
| Label    | Metric A     || Metric B     ||
| ^^       | v1    | v2    | v1    | v2    |
|----------|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|
| Group A  | x     | x     | x     |       |
| ^^       | x     |       | x     | x     |
| Group B  | x     | x     |       |       |
| ^^       |       | x     | x     | x     |
| Group C  | x     | x     | x     | x     |
cell (h2,2) fill=#dbeafe
cell (h2,4) fill=#d1fae5
cell 1 highlight
cell 4 highlight
